 },
 "hook": {
  "zh": "凌晨四点十七分，我推开那扇门去查家族的账，门后的男人只穿了一件浴袍——七分钟后，全纽约都以为我是去偷情的。",
  "en": "4:17 a.m. I opened that door to audit my family's books. Seven minutes later all of New York thought I was having an affair."
 },
 "premise": {
  "zh": "你是 Victoria Vale，维尔集团第三代。一条匿名消息把你带到克罗斯酒店 417 房。",
  "en": "You are Victoria Vale, third generation of the Vale Group. One anonymous message brought you to Room 417."
 },
 "orient": "bg",
